Model Files:
​pytorch_model.bin (The actual model weights)
​config.json (Model architecture configuration)
​modules.json (Crucial for sentence-transformers to define the sequence of layers)
​config_sentence_transformers.json
​sentence_bert_config.json
​Tokenizer Files:
​tokenizer_config.json
​tokenizer.json
​vocab.txt
​special_tokens_map.json
​Pooling Configuration:
​Create a subfolder named 1_Pooling and download the config.json file located inside the 1_Pooling folder on Hugging Face.
​2. Local Folder Structure
​Organize the downloaded files on your local disk (e.g., in a folder named local_model) like this:

/your_project_directory/
└── local_model/
    ├── pytorch_model.bin
    ├── config.json
    ├── modules.json
    ├── tokenizer_config.json
    ├── tokenizer.json
    ├── vocab.txt
    ├── ... (other root files)
    └── 1_Pooling/
        └── config.json
